View GPU information and configure NVIDIA GPU settings.

Usage:
  spela gpu [command]

Available Commands:
  info          Show GPU information
  profile-reset Make a GPU profile field follow All games
  reset         Reset GPU clocks to default
  set           Set GPU profile for a game
  show          Show GPU profile for a game

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for gpu

Use "spela gpu [command] --help" for more information about a command.
